---
import Todo from '../components/Todo.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Frequently asked questions"
  description="Answers to common questions about WoSM Academy: cost, prerequisites, certificates, accreditation, time, enrolment and teaching."
  lead="Short answers to common questions. If yours is not here, see Contact."
>
  <div class="accordion">
    <details id="free">
      <summary>Is it really free?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>There are many high-quality courses that are free. Paid courses are essential to maintain high quality and availability of courses at WoSM.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="prior-knowledge">
      <summary>Do I need any prior knowledge?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>
          It depends on the course. Each course page lists its prerequisites, if it has any. Introductory courses are a
          good place to start.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="certificate">
      <summary>Do I get a certificate?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
		  <p>No official certifcates are issued. 
		  As implied in the WoSM manifesto, we do not believe in the certificates, we believe in your true effort.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="accreditation">
      <summary>Is WoSM Academy accredited?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>WoSM Academy is not accredited and the high quality of the courses are maintained by working teachers.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="time">
      <summary>How much time do I need per week?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>Each course page gives an estimate of the weekly effort. Plan for it before you enrol.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="several-courses">
      <summary>Can I take several courses at once?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
		  <p>Even though there is no limit on the number of courses you may be enrolled in, we suggest simultaneous enrollment to <strong>5 courses at max</strong> to ensure high dedication and mastery of the subjects you are trying to learn.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="confirmation-email">
      <summary>I didn’t receive the confirmation email.</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>
          Wait a few minutes, then check your spam or junk folder. Make sure you typed your address correctly when you
          signed up. If it still has not arrived, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email.general}`}
            >{site.email.general}</a
          > and tell us the address you used.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="teach">
      <summary>How can I teach at WoSM Academy?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>
          Instructors are volunteers. Read <a href="/teach/">Teach with us</a> for what the role involves and how to apply
          by email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="language">
      <summary>In what language are courses taught?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>English.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details id="support">
      <summary>How can I support the Academy?</summary>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>
		If you are an investor/sponsor, you may kindly consider funding the project. 
		You can also help by telling others about the Academy, or by
     	<a href="/teach/">teaching a course</a> if you are an instructor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<script>
  // Open the question named in the URL fragment, e.g. /faq/#certificate.
  const open = () => {
    const target = window.location.hash && document.getElementById(window.location.hash.slice(1));
    if (target instanceof HTMLDetailsElement) target.open = true;
  };
  open();
  window.addEventListener('hashchange', open);
</script>
